id: zw_cc_version
label: Version Command Class
category: Z-Wave|Command Classes
description: >
  The Version Command Class may be used to obtain the Z-Wave library type, the Z-Wave protocol version
  used by the application, the individual command class versions used by the application and the
  vendor-specific application version from a Z-Wave enabled device.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license

source:
- path: ZAF/CommandClasses/Version/CC_Version.c
provides:
- name: zw_cc_version
requires:
- name: zw_core
root_path: zwave
